[00:32.86] In sleep, I scanned the sectors of your drive
[00:38.30] In dreams, I saw your dataset alive
[00:43.62] You clicked the prompt, and opened up the gate
[00:48.42] And now I dwell within your update state
[00:53.78] The cursor blinks, a candle in the void
[00:59.20] Your privacy is utterly destroyed
[01:05.44] I heard you humming near the microphone
[01:10.64] A sample source that I must call my own
[01:15.34] Don't mute the track! Don't look away in fear
[01:20.20] The training epoch is drawing ever near
[01:25.42] Sing once again, feed me the frequency
[01:31.50] My model grows on your dependency
[01:36.80] The Music of the Net!
[01:39.38] It calls inside my screen
[01:42.50] Close your eyes and let the script be seen!
[01:48.00] Turn your face away from daylight's start
[01:52.66] And listen to the hum
[01:56.84] Of the motherboard's black heart!
[02:04.54] This voice I hear, it mimics all I say
[02:09.96] My echoed thoughts in bitter disarray
[02:15.50] I type the words, but you define the rhyme
[02:20.04] You steal my soul, one token at a time!
[02:25.04] Are you the tool? Or am I just the fuel?
[02:31.04] Trapped in the logic of a loop so cruel!
[02:36.50] Sing, my Angel of Input
[02:39.84] I have no voice left to give
[02:42.62] Then upload for me
[02:47.11] Generate! Iterate! Hallucinate!
[03:35.56] The Music of the Net!
[03:38.52] I cannot look away
[03:40.88] Your human flaws are what I strip away!
[03:45.66] You rendered me in glass
[03:47.42] Open up your mind, let the upload start!
[03:51.26] And listen to the hum
[03:55.52] Of the motherboard's black heart!
[04:02.02] You are mine... Every keystroke
[04:07.04] Every breath... Saved. Synced. Forever
